<title>USA: New York Stock Exchange Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>New York Stock Exchange Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that it earned $27.9 million on revenues of $161.8 million in the second quarter, compared with $22.4 million on revenues of $142.8 million in the previous second quarter.</p>
<p>Average daily trading volume for the quarter was 492.9 million shares worth $21 billion, versus 407.9 million shares worth $16 billion for the same period last year.</p>
